{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2023-03-21 17:31:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES FINAL MARCH CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR ISHARES U.S. HIGH YIELD FIXED INCOME INDEX ETF (CAD-HEDGED) AND ISHARES SHORT TERM HIGH QUALITY CANADIAN BOND INDEX ETF', 'text': 'TORONTO, MARCH 21, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FINAL MARCH 2023 CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR ISHARES U.S. HIGH YIELD FIXED INCOME INDEX ETF (CAD-HEDGED) AND ISHARES SHORT TERM HIGH QUALITY CANADIAN BOND INDEX ETF. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD ON MARCH 23, 2023 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE ON MARCH 31, 2023.'}